          "en-US": "Non-custodial Stellar wallet with time-locked vaults"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Stellar TimeLock is a non-custodial Stellar (XLM) wallet. Your keys stay on your device.\n\n* Time-lock vaults: lock XLM or Stellar tokens until a date you choose, enforced by Soroban smart contracts\n* Cooling-off and vesting vaults\n* Send, receive and swap, signed on the device\n* Multiple wallets and an address book\n* Optional biometric unlock\n\nThis is the fdroid build: no Firebase/FCM, Google Play services, ML Kit or Play install referrer. QR scanning uses ZXing.\n\nSource available under GPL-3.0-or-later. This repository is run by the Stellar TimeLock project, and the app is signed with the same key as our direct-download builds."
        },
